    "detailed_description": "<h1>YOU CAN ALSO CHECK MY OTHER UPCOMING GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Atmospheric slow-burn indie horror game.</strong><br>It is a slow-burn story in a realistic environment with the atmosphere of abandoned places. It has few jumpscares but in the right place and time to fit in the story.<br><br>In 1996, a student begins working as a night guard at an abandoned factory which was built before the Second World War on the outskirts of Berlin. <br>Spending the night shifts alone, the player begins to uncover the dark history of the factory and the local legends that surround it.<br>Will be able to survive the confrontation with the darkness lurking within the walls of the old factory?<br><br>- atmosphere of urban exploring<br>- movie storytelling<br>- find out dark secrets of the old factory<br>- explore the realistic environment<br>- VHS style<br>- two endings<br>- unique and horryfying enemy representation<br>- atmosphere of the 80s/90s<br>- surprising jump scares<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234890/extras/e0dd2b589968ac59e2ab85b880dde938.poster.avif?t=1685880867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234890/extras/e0dd2b589968ac59e2ab85b880dde938.webm?t=1685880867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234890/extras/e0dd2b589968ac59e2ab85b880dde938.mp4?t=1685880867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br>Lenght:<br>1,5 - 2,5 hours<br>The game is geared towards unique experience rather than length.<br><br>Saves: <br>Save system is in the form of chapters divided into smaller parts that unlock as you play. <br>Just like in the movie, you can go back to the interesting part of the story one more time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234890/extras/6588820a004f3f1b851faebc325e2e0a.poster.avif?t=1685880867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234890/extras/6588820a004f3f1b851faebc325e2e0a.webm?t=1685880867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
